      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "so the rubber-stamp rate becomes measurable rather than a suspicion, and \"who approved this?\" has an answer",
      "originalText": "so the rubber-stamp rate becomes measurable rather than a suspicion, and \"who approved this?\" has an answer",
      "fontSize": 9.5,
